n="00:32.660" end="00:32.930">then </span><span begin="00:32.930" end="00:33.440">learned </span><span begin="00:33.440" end="00:33.500">to </span><span begin="00:33.500" end="00:35.120">scream</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.890" end="00:41.660"><span begin="00:36.890" end="00:37.100">You </span><span begin="00:37.100" end="00:37.550">can't </span><span begin="00:37.550" end="00:38.660">understand</span><span begin="00:38.660" end="00:38.690">, </span><span begin="00:38.690" end="00:39.200">when </span><span begin="00:39.200" end="00:39.440">you're </span><span begin="00:39.440" end="00:39.920">fed </span><span begin="00:39.920" end="00:40.310">from </span><span begin="00:40.310" end="00:40.370">a </span><span begin="00:40.370" end="00:40.820">TV </span><span begin="00:40.820" end="00:41.660">screen</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.500" end="00:46.460"><span begin="00:42.500" end="00:42.920">You </span><span begin="00:42.920" end="00:43.310">can't </span><span begin="00:43.310" end="00:43.790">see </span><span begin="00:43.790" end="00:43.880">the </span><span begin="00:43.880" end="00:44.390">things </span><span begin="00:44.390" end="00:44.810">that </span><span begin="00:44.810" end="00:44.990">I </span><span begin="00:44.990" end="00:45.380">can </span><span begin="00:45.380" end="00:46.460">see</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.420" end="00:52.490"><span begin="00:47.420" end="00:47.930">But </span><span begin="00:47.930" end="00:48.140">I </span><span begin="00:48.140" end="00:49.790">forget</span><span begin="00:49.790" end="00:49.820">, </span><span begin="00:49.820" end="00:50.120">that </span><span begin="00:50.120" end="00:50.360">you </span><span begin="00:50.360" end="00:50.780">thank </span><span begin="00:50.780" end="00:51.260">God </span><span begin="00:51.260" end="00:51.350">and </span><span begin="00:51.350" end="00:52.490">pray</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.520" end="00:55.550"><span begin="00:52.520" end="00:52.970">Some </span><span begin="00:52.970" end="00:53.420">things </span><span begin="00:53.420" end="00:53.780">just </span><span begin="00:53.780" end="00:54.200">never </span><span begin="00:54.200" end="00:55.550">stay</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.610" end="00:59.420"><span begin="00:55.610" end="00:55.820">And </span><span begin="00:55.820" end="00:56.090">we </span><span begin="00:56.090" end="00:56.330">all </span><span begin="00:56.330" end="00:56.660">just </span><span begin="00:56.660" end="00:57.350">slip </span><span begin="00:57.350" end="00:59.420">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.450" end="01:01.670"><span begin="00:59.450" end="00:59.870">This </span><span begin="00:59.870" end="01:00.110">can't </span><span begin="01:00.110" end="01:00.290">be </span><span begin="01:00.290" end="01:00.410">the </span><span begin="01:00.410" end="01:00.740">real </span><span begin="01:00.740" end="01:01.160">world </span><span begin="01:01.160" end="01:01.670">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.730" end="01:05.270"><span begin="01:01.730" end="01:01.850">I </span><span begin="01:01.850" end="01:02.270">don't </span><span begin="01:02.270" end="01:02.930">believe </span><span begin="01:02.930" end="01:03.170">it</span><span begin="01:03.170" end="01:03.200">, </span><span begin="01:03.200" end="01:03.440">when </span><span begin="01:03.440" end="01:03.590">I </span><span begin="01:03.590" end="01:03.920">can't </span><span begin="01:03.920" end="01:04.280">see </span><span begin="01:04.280" end="01:04.610">the </span><span begin="01:04.610" end="01:05.270">truth</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.330" end="01:07.580"><span begin="01:05.330" end="01:05.990">Welcome </span><span begin="01:05.990" end="01:06.170">to </span><span begin="01:06.170" end="01:06.350">the </span><span begin="01:06.350" end="01:06.680">real </span><span begin="01:06.680" end="01:07.100">world </span><span begin="01:07.100" end="01:07.580">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.610" end="01:11.840"><span begin="01:07.610" end="01:07.820">The </span><span begin="01:07.820" end="01:08.150">old </span><span begin="01:08.150" end="01:08.330">are </span><span begin="01:08.330" end="01:09.230">carried </span><span begin="01:09.230" end="01:09.560">in </span><span begin="01:09.560" end="01:10.190">only </span><span begin="01:10.190" end="01:10.550">to </span><span begin="01:10.550" end="01:11.360">poison </span><span begin="01:11.360" end="01:11.840">youth</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.840" end="01:15.710"><span begin="01:11.840" end="01:12.170">Am </span><span begin="01:12.170" end="01:13.250">I</span><span begin="01:13.250" end="01:13.250">, </span><span begin="01:13.250" end="01:13.460">the </span><span begin="01:13.460" end="01:13.730">only </span><span begin="01:13.730" end="01:14.060">one </span><span begin="01:14.060" end="01:14.240">who </span><span begin="01:14.240" end="01:14.750">thinks </span><span begin="01:14.750" end="01:15.050">it's </span><span begin="01:15.050" end="01:15.710">tragic</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.040" end="01:17.210"><span begin="01:16.040" end="01:16.430">'Cause </span><span begin="01:16.430" end="01:16.700">I </span><span begin="01:16.700" end="01:17.210">know</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.240" end="01:19.790"><span begin="01:17.240" end="01:17.630">This </span><span begin="01:17.630" end="01:17.870">can't </span><span begin="01:17.870" end="01:18.050">be </span><span begin="01:18.050" end="01:18.200">the </span><span begin="01:18.200" end="01:18.530">real </span><span begin="01:18.530" end="01:18.950">world </span><span begin="01:18.950" end="01:19.790">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.880" end="01:21.230"><span begin="01:19.880" end="01:20.000">Oh </span><span begin="01:20.000" end="01:20.420">no </span><span begin="01:20.420" end="01:21.230">oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.230" end="01:23.570"><span begin="01:21.230" end="01:21.290">Oh </span><span begin="01:21.290" end="01:21.890">no </span><span begin="01:21.890" end="01:23.570">oh</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.290" end="01:29.780"><span begin="01:24.290" end="01:24.410">I </span><span begin="01:24.410" end="01:24.770">look </span><span begin="01:24.770" end="01:25.130">for </span><span begin="01:25.130" end="01:25.430">some </span><span begin="01:25.430" end="01:26.120">hope </span><span begin="01:26.120" end="01:26.420">in </span><span begin="01:26.420" end="01:26.780">every </span><span begin="01:26.780" end="01:27.440">face </span><span begin="01:27.440" end="01:27.710">there's </span><span begin="01:27.710" end="01:27.800">a </span><span begin="01:27.800" end="01:28.310">vacant </span><span begin="01:28.310" end="01:29.780">stare</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.810" end="01:33.770"><span begin="01:29.810" end="01:29.960">The </span><span begin="01:29.960" end="01:30.560">shadows </span><span begin="01:30.560" end="01:31.250">come </span><span begin="01:31.250" end="01:31.460">but </span><span begin="01:31.460" end="01:31.880">no </span><span begin="01:31.880" end="01:32.150">one </span><span begin="01:32.150" end="01:32.660">seems </span><span begin="01:32.660" end="01:32.750">to </span><span begin="01:32.750" end="01:33.770">care</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.470" end="01:41.030"><span begin="01:36.470" end="01:36.650">The </span><span begin="01:36.650" end="01:37.250">darkness </span><span begin="01:37.250" end="01:38.150">floods </span><span begin="01:38.150" end="01:38.660">every </span><span begin="01:38.660" end="01:39.110">light </span><span begin="01:39.110" end="01:39.440">that </span><span begin="01:39.440" end="01:39.620">could </span><span begin="01:39.620" end="01:40.190">promise </span><span begin="01:40.190" end="01:41.030">change</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.750" end="01:45.290"><span begin="01:41.750" end="01:42.170">She </span><span begin="01:42.170" end="01:42.560">passed </span><span begin="01:42.560" end="01:43.070">sound </span><span begin="01:43.070" end="01:43.550">asleep </span><span begin="01:43.550" end="01:43.880">when </span><span begin="01:43.880" end="01:44.030">the </span><span begin="01:44.030" end="01:44.420">blood </span><span begin="01:44.420" end="01:44.570">is </span><span begin="01:44.570" end="01:45.290">stain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.320" end="01:46.610"><span begin="01:45.320" end="01:45.530">But </span><span begin="01:45.530" end="01:45.890">blood </span><span begin="01:45.890" end="01:46.130">is </span><span begin="01:46.130" end="01:46.610">pain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.610" end="01:51.650"><span begin="01:46.610" end="01:47.390">Somewhere </span><span begin="01:47.390" end="01:47.570">I </span><span begin="01:47.570" end="01:49.010">know</span><span begin="01:49.010" end="01:49.040">, </span><span begin="01:49.040" end="01:49.400">that </span><span begin="01:49.400" end="01:49.640">I'm </span><span begin="01:49.640" end="01:50.060">not </span><span begin="01:50.060" end="01:50.510">all </span><span begin="01:50.510" end="01:51.650">alone</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.680" end="01:54.590"><span begin="01:51.680" end="01:51.890">With </span><span begin="01:51.890" end="01:52.250">this </span><span begin="01:52.250" end="01:52.760">bated </span><span begin="01:52.760" end="01:53.270">breath </span><span begin="01:53.270" end="01:53.510">I </span><span begin="01:53.510" end="01:54.590">hold</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.650" end="01:57.470"><span begin="01:54.650" end="01:55.100">My </span><span begin="01:55.100" end="01:55.580">lungs </span><span begin="01:55.580" end="01:55.910">want </span><span begin="01:55.910" end="01:56.210">to </span><span begin="01:56.210" end="01:57.470">explode</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.670" end="02:00.890"><span begin="01:58.670" end="01:59.090">This </span><span begin="01:59.090" end="01:59.330">can't </s